Package: tennisage
Type: Package
Title: Retrieves career matches from tennisabstract.com and creates plot for a given player
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Author: Irene Chen
Maintainer: Irene Chen <chenirene@berkeley.edu>
Description: Package to retrieve career match data of a given player from tennisabstract.com, then creates a plot visualization of player age against their age difference with their opponent, with points colored by match result. 
